  <name>Hop-tunes</name>
  <summary>Local-first music player with private local profiles</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      Hop-tunes is a calm, fast music player for your own files. It works fully offline:
      no accounts, no sign-in, no store and no telemetry.
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>Gapless playback of MP3, FLAC, AAC/M4A, Ogg, Opus, WAV and WMA</li>
      <li>Fast incremental library scanning that never modifies your files</li>
      <li>A typography-led interface with collection, now playing and quickplay views</li>
    </ul>
  </description>
  <launchable type="desktop-id">io.github.thestylewithin.hoptunes.desktop</launchable>
